# ── Recommended: Cal.com (automatic emails + real Google Meet links) ──
# 1. Create a free account at https://cal.com
# 2. Connect Google Calendar and enable Google Meet for video
# 3. Create a 30-minute event type (e.g. "Strategy Call")
# 4. Paste your event slug below (the part after cal.com/)
#    Example: if your link is https://cal.com/huma-taj/30min → huma-taj/30min
VITE_CAL_LINK=

# ── Fallback: Formspree (custom booking widget on the site) ──
# Used only when VITE_CAL_LINK is empty. Sends booking details to your inbox.
# 1. Create a free form at https://formspree.io
# 2. Set notification email to humatajdev01@gmail.com
# 3. Optional: enable auto-responder so guests get a confirmation email too
# 4. Paste the form id (the xxxx in https://formspree.io/f/xxxx)
VITE_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=
